  data-end="491"><strong data-start="148" data-end="157">Date:</strong> Tue
 sday\, 22 October (during your scheduled class time)<br data-start="220" d
 ata-end="223"><strong data-start="223" data-end="235">Content:</strong> Th
 e test will cover material from <strong data-start="270" data-end="289">Le
 ctures 1 to 5</strong>.<br data-start="290" data-end="293"><strong data-st
 art="293" data-end="304">Format:</strong> The test will consist of <strong
  data-start="330" data-end="359">multiple-choice questions</strong>\, comp
 leted online via Canvas using <strong data-start="395" data-end="425">Resp
 ondus LockDown Browser</strong>.<br data-start="426" data-end="429"><stron
 g data-start="429" data-end="442" data-is-only-node="">Duration:</strong> 
 You will have <strong data-start="457" data-end="467">1 hour</strong> to c
 omplete the test.</p>\n<h3 data-start="493" data-end="517">Academic Integr
 ity</h3>\n<p data-start="518" data-end="601">All students are expected to 
 adhere to the highest standards of academic honesty.</p>\n<ul data-start="
 602" data-end="831">\n<li data-start="602" data-end="831">\n<p data-start=
 "604" data-end="716">Any instance of academic misconduct—including <stro
 ng data-start="650" data-end="698">cheating\, plagiarism\, or the use of A
 I tools</strong>—will result in:</p>\n<ul data-start="719" data-end="831
 ">\n<li data-start="719" data-end="759">\n<p data-start="721" data-end="75
 9">A grade of <strong data-start="732" data-end="744">zero (0)</strong> on
  the test.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="762" data-end="831">\n<p data-start
 ="764" data-end="831">A formal report submitted to the school’s discipli
 nary committee.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="833" data-
 end="903">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p><br><br></p>
