CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:This is your third Self-Study Activity.  It consists on record
 ing yourself speaking for 2–3 minutes on one social or economic issue th
 at interests you. You may choose a topic such as unemployment\, inflation\
 , inequality\, migration\, education\, globalization\, AI\, tourism\, clim
 ate change\, housing\, consumer behavior\, youth employment\, or another r
 elevant issue.\n\nIn your recording:\n\n* Explain the issue in your own wo
 rds.\n\n* Give one concrete example\, preferably from Morocco or another c
 ountry.\n\n* Explain why the issue matters.\n\n* Give your personal opinio
 n.\n\nImportant: \n\n* Do NOT write or read a script.\n\n* You may prepar
 e up to 5 keywords only.\n\n* Do NOT use ChatGPT or other AI tools to prep
 are your answer.\n\n* Speak naturally. Small pauses and mistakes are accep
 table.\n\n* Record your answer in one take.\n\n* Submit an audio or video 
 recording on Canvas.\n\nLength: 2–3 minutes
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Self-Study Activity N°3 [LAN108P]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://um6p.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _11216&month=11&year=2026#assignment_36093
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>This is your third Self-Study Activity.&nbs
 p\; It consists on recording yourself speaking for 2–3 minutes on one so
 cial or economic issue that interests you. You may choose a topic such as 
 unemployment\, inflation\, inequality\, migration\, education\, globalizat
 ion\, AI\, tourism\, climate change\, housing\, consumer behavior\, youth 
 employment\, or another relevant issue.</p>\n<p><strong>In your recording:
 </strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><em><strong>Explain the issue in your own words.<
 /strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong>Give one concrete example\, preferably
  from Morocco or another country.</strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong>Expl
 ain why the issue matters.</strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong>Give your p
 ersonal opinion.</strong></em></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Important:&nbsp\;</
 strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do NOT write or read a script.</li>\n<li>You may pr
 epare up to 5 keywords only.</li>\n<li>Do NOT use ChatGPT or other AI tool
 s to prepare your answer.</li>\n<li>Speak naturally. Small pauses and mist
 akes are acceptable.</li>\n<li>Record your answer in one take.</li>\n<li>S
 ubmit an audio or video recording on Canvas.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Lengt
 h: 2–3 minutes</strong></p>
END:VEVENT
